  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering farmer groups towards livelihood improvement through sustainable agriculture in Pursat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to improve the livelihoods of vulnerable rural households through sustainable agriculture and to strengthen relationships in Pursat through capacity building to small-scale farmers to innovate and adapt agricultural techniques in order to improve their food security through SRI and Saving for Change. The project will build the capacity of four farmer associations, supporting them to function more effectively and to act on community concerns. Members of farmer associations will be supported to work with other farmers in the community to increase and diversify agricultural production and to improve the quality of market-oriented agricultural products.</narrative>
  </description>
